I'll run: fp16 blocks (8192, 16384, 32768) × modes (0=copy, 2=series) at grids 40/80/160 + GC40/GC80 for block 8192; bf16 same with 2 blocks; fp32 blocks (4096, 8192, 16384) with both modes.

